      "title": "Human Resources",
      "description": "Faculty Per Course - Human Resources Skip to main content Acadia Home Apply Donate myAcadia Keywords Acadia Home Apply Donate myAcadia Acadia University Keywords Human Resources Faculty Per Course Postings Under the terms of the 17th Collective Agreement , and in accordance with Article 58.10(a) (ii), the University invites applications from all qualified individuals; however, candidates eligible to work in Canada shall be given priority. First consideration shall be given to internal candidates as defined in Article 58.11(b)(i) of the Collective Agreement (Internal applicants are all individuals on the Precedence List as defined in Articles 11.12(a), 11.12 (b) and 11.12(m) and all Full-Time Employees.). How to Apply : Please refer to specific instructions detailed on the job posting. Faculty of Arts (Arts, Classics, Economics, English, French, German, History, Philosophy, Politics, Sociology, Spanish) Job opportunities Job Title Location Category Apply No jobs available Faculty of Professional Studies (Business Administration, Community Development, Education, Kinesiology, Music) Job opportunities Job Title Location Category Apply No jobs available Faculty of Pure and Applied Science (Biology, Chemistry, Computer Science, Earth & Environmental Science, Engineering, Mathematics & Statistics, Nutrition & Dietetics, Physics, Psychology) Job opportunities Job Title Location Category Apply No jobs available Skip navigation Welcome Benefits Employment Career Opportunities Payroll Manager's Toolkit Employee's Toolkit Collective Agreements/Terms of Employment University Policies Forms Contact Our Team Like Nowhere Else Acadia University 15 University Avenue Wolfville, Nova Scotia B4P 2R6 Canada Acadia University is located in Mi'kma'ki, the ancestral and unceded territory of the Mi’kmaw nation. Skip navigation Welcome Benefits FAQs Carrier Contact Numbers Mental Health Resources Crisis Intervention Ongoing Resources Employment Career Opportunities Payroll Manager's Toolkit Employee's Toolkit Connect HR Calendar Collective Agreements/Terms of Employment University Policies Forms Contact Our Team myAcadia Apply Donate previous next start slideshow"
